{
    "title": "Whip Master",
    "description": "\ud83e\udd20 Looking for whip games? Enjoying casual rope games with lots of levels? Whip master is a casual game where you need to fight bad guys using a pocket whip. Become a real force master, hit em up and throw out of the way. Complete level by level to win the game.\r\n\r\nIn this rope game you are a treasure hunter and whip master. \ud83d\udca5 Defeat all enemies on your way to wealth. Use the power of your pocket whip to hit em up. But to kill bad guys you need to be trickier. Catch the enemy and throw it into the sea. Or grab the bad guy and hold him until he dies. Use different super power whips and techniques to defeat bad guys in the whip game.\r\n\r\nFollow the map to go from one world to another. \ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Open new rope power and get more different rewards from money to gems. The more levels you complete the more additional rewards and new whips you get in the whip game. Complete the levels and get a new super power whip and next map.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcab MAIN HIGHLIGHTS \ud83d\udcab\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfaf Complete missions\r\nAdd more challenges to the casual game and complete additional missions. For example, kill 100 enemies or do 35 headshots. Complete missions and get a super power whip or game money as a reward.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd13 Unlock new pocket whips\r\nPass the levels, get rewards or complete missions to open different power whips. Use colorful ropes or get a whip with superpower. You can unlock the whip that creates a bubble around the bad guy and throws him into in the air. Or get a shocking whip with the lightning power. \r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf81 Take part in bonus levels\r\nChallenge yourself and try to kill more bad guys. At this level, you will receive a new unusual pocket whip, for example, with rockets. Defeat all enemies and the boss to complete the bonus level and get a reward.\r\n\r\n\ud83e\uddbe Upgrade your power hands\r\nCollect game money to open new features. Choose the right gloves that best fit your super power whip. Upgrade your whip master to have more fun in the casual game.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd25 Use extra objects to kill bad guys \r\nBe careful! With each level, enemies become stronger. Look around to find something that helps to kill them faster. Explode barrels with dangerous substances to kill all enemies at once in the whip & rope game. \r\n\r\nDownload Whip Master to defeat bad guys in the 3D rope game. Use the super power of your pocket whip to complete levels and have fun. \ud83c\udfae",
    "descriptionHTML": "\ud83e\udd20 Looking for whip games? Enjoying casual rope games with lots of levels? Whip master is a casual game where you need to fight bad guys using a pocket whip. Become a real force master, hit em up and throw out of the way. Complete level by level to win the game.<br><br>In this rope game you are a treasure hunter and whip master. \ud83d\udca5 Defeat all enemies on your way to wealth. Use the power of your pocket whip to hit em up. But to kill bad guys you need to be trickier. Catch the enemy and throw it into the sea. Or grab the bad guy and hold him until he dies. Use different super power whips and techniques to defeat bad guys in the whip game.<br><br>Follow the map to go from one world to another. \ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Open new rope power and get more different rewards from money to gems. The more levels you complete the more additional rewards and new whips you get in the whip game. Complete the levels and get a new super power whip and next map.<br><br>\ud83d\udcab MAIN HIGHLIGHTS \ud83d\udcab<br><br>\ud83c\udfaf Complete missions<br>Add more challenges to the casual game and complete additional missions. For example, kill 100 enemies or do 35 headshots. Complete missions and get a super power whip or game money as a reward.<br><br>\ud83d\udd13 Unlock new pocket whips<br>Pass the levels, get rewards or complete missions to open different power whips. Use colorful ropes or get a whip with superpower. You can unlock the whip that creates a bubble around the bad guy and throws him into in the air. Or get a shocking whip with the lightning power. <br><br>\ud83c\udf81 Take part in bonus levels<br>Challenge yourself and try to kill more bad guys. At this level, you will receive a new unusual pocket whip, for example, with rockets. Defeat all enemies and the boss to complete the bonus level and get a reward.<br><br>\ud83e\uddbe Upgrade your power hands<br>Collect game money to open new features. Choose the right gloves that best fit your super power whip. Upgrade your whip master to have more fun in the casual game.<br><br>\ud83d\udd25 Use extra objects to kill bad guys <br>Be careful! With each level, enemies become stronger. Look around to find something that helps to kill them faster. Explode barrels with dangerous substances to kill all enemies at once in the whip &amp; rope game. <br><br>Download Whip Master to defeat bad guys in the 3D rope game. Use the super power of your pocket whip to complete levels and have fun. \ud83c\udfae",
